<%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'Terms & Conditions' }) %>

<main class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 px-4 py-10 text-slate-100">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute -left-40 -top-40 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-brand-600/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -right-40 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-violet-600/20 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <a href="/dashboard" class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-400 transition hover:text-brand-300"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Back to dashboard</a>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl sm:p-12">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-violet-600 shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/40"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text text-2xl text-white"></i></div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">1. Service Bookings</h2>
          <p>Appointments are confirmed only after a service slot is assigned by the workshop. Booking a slot does not guarantee immediate service availability.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">2. Cancellations &amp; Rescheduling</h2>
          <p>You may reschedule or cancel appointments through the platform. Repeated no-shows may affect future booking privileges.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">3. Subscription Plans</h2>
          <p>Plans provide access to bundled services as described at purchase. Prices and inclusions may change with notice; active plans are honored until expiry.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">4. Liability</h2>
          <p>Our partner service centers are responsible for the quality of repairs performed. Personal belongings left in vehicles should be removed before drop-off.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">5. Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p>Accounts must not be used for fraudulent bookings, spam broadcasts, or any unlawful activity. We may suspend accounts that violate these terms.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
